                    Design: I propose to extend test‐time                       
                    augmentation by including vertical                          
                    flips in addition to the existing                           
                    horizontal flips, generating four                           
                    predictions (original, horizontal flip,                     
                    vertical flip, and both flips) and                          
                    averaging their probabilities. We will                      
                    update the cross-validation validation                      
                    loop to compute AUC using this 4‐view                       
                    TTA ensemble, then retrain on the full                      
                    dataset and apply the same TTA in the                       
                    `predict()` function. This atomic                           
                    change should improve robustness and                        
                    slightly boost the AUROC by capturing                       
                    more invariances. The rest of the                           
                    pipeline remains unchanged.                                 
