                    successfully without errors.                                
                    Cross-validation AUROC scores ranged                        
                    from 0.9041 to 0.9219, with a mean                          
                    AUROC of 0.9152 ± 0.0063, indicating                        
                    strong model performance. The model was                     
                    retrained on the full dataset with                          
                    fairness sampling based on skin tone,                       
