                    simple aug, strong baseline     |                           
                    | DenseNet121 finetune (5 epochs, flip                      
                    aug)| 0.9195      | First high AUROC,                       
                    no fairness handling           |                            
                    | + TTA (4-view)                                            
                    | 0.924       | Stable, low-variance                        
