                    ### Key Technical Insights                                  
                                                                                
                    - **Augmentation is crucial**:                              
                    Improved cropping, rotation, color and                      
                    erasing led to non-trivial gains in                         
                    generalization and AUROC.                                   
                    - **TTA and Ensembling**: Averaging                         
                    across multiple augmentations and                           
                    model seeds/folds gives strong, stable                      
                    improvements—ensemble of 5 DenseNet                         
